Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.19 159/671] ath10k: fix dma unmap direction for management frames
Date:   Thu, 16 Jan 2020 11:51:08 -0500
Message-Id: <20200116165940.10720-42-sashal@kernel.org>
